<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">    \item</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> A formal description of the simulatorâ€™s RSVP dynamics.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">    \item</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> A taxonomy of emergent takeoff regimes.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">    \item</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> Implications for AI alignment and governance.</span></span>
