<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\item</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);"> \textbf</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214); font-weight: bold;">Emergent complexity</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">}: Phase transitions arise naturally from field equations</span></span>
