<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\item</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> Formal derivation of RSVP field equations and stability theorems.</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\item</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> Description of the Stars! simulator architecture and evolutionary dynamics.</span></span>
