<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">Factory placement is governed by the genome component </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\mathbf{d} </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\in</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);"> \Delta</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">^</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">3</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">, which specifies the proportional allocation of factory construction budget across the four types. At each generation, the empire computes its total factory construction budget as:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\[</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">B_f = </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\xi</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);"> \cdot</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);"> \sum</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">_{k </span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\in</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> \{\text{Ir, Bo, Ge}\}} R_k</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">where </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\xi</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);"> \in</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> [</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">0.1</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">, </span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">0.9</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">]</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> is the expansion rate parameter from the genome, and </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">R_k</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> are current resource stockpiles.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">The number of factories of type </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">j</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> constructed is:</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\[</span></span>
