<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">In sum, the clarifying questions and counterâ€‘rebuttals I provided earlier are directly applicable to this paper. The RSVP model is a thoughtful attempt to combine thermodynamic metaphors, gameâ€‘like simulation and philosophical argument, but its conclusions depend heavily on its assumptions and may not generalise to actual AI systems.Greatâ€”hereâ€™s a direct, RSVP-native answer to each item. Iâ€™ll keep the tone technical and tie every claim back to the Î¦/ð’—/S picture, the lamphronâ€“lamphrodyne relaxation story, and the simulation choices youâ€™ve been using.</p>
