<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">To move RSVP from speculation to science, we define explicit falsification criteria.</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\paragraph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{Test 1: Training-Run Entropy Bound.}</span></span>
