<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">We assume that macroscopic work density </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\Phi</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">(t)</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);"> corresponds to normalized energy productivity:</span></span>
