<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">\]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">we estimate </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\lambda</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">_c</span><span style="color: rgb(86, 156, 214);">\simeq</span><span style="color: rgb(181, 206, 168);">0.42</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">, matching the bifurcation parameter found in simulations.</span></span>
