<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\paragraph</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{Conclusion.}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">RSVP reproduces historical energy and innovation trajectories without free parameters beyond those calibrated here, suggesting that its phenomenological constants correspond to real macro-economic thermodynamics.</span></span>
