<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">Every attempt at total rationalizationâ€”be it cosmic, economic, or algorithmicâ€”violates </span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\frac</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{d</span><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\mathcal</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{F}}{dt}&lt;0</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);">$</span><span style="color: rgb(78, 201, 176);"> and must decay into plurality.  </span></span>
